💰  NEW IN METATRONICS: CASHBACK ON PARTNER DEPOSITS

Invite partners and receive cashback from their deposits from 3 levels:

🟡 LVL1 — 10%
🟡 LVL 2 — 5%
🟡 LVL 3 — 3%

The cashback is calculated automatically and appears immediately under Career → Cashback.

In the app, you can see:

• the partner’s name;
• their line and the amounts;
• the deposit amount;
• your cashback amount;
• the date when the cashback becomes available.

For example, a partner on your first line deposited $1000. The system calculated $100 in cashback — exactly 10%.

How the holding period works:

• the cashback is held for 30 days maturity;
• if the partner withdraws part of the funds, the cashback is reduced proportionally;
• if the partner withdraws the full amount, the cashback is Forfeited;
• on Day 31, the cashback is credited to your income wallet.

The app displays three statuses: Frozen, Credited, and Forfeited.

Watch the demonstration video to see how a new cashback transaction appears in the app and where you can track its status.

Open METATRONICS → Career → Cashback and share your referral link:

🔗 Open App

Cashback depends on partner deposits and their subsequent actions. Financial transactions involve risk.
